# Road asphalt for the bus park (solid): m with sparse 2 px d grain, an
# i/i/d kerb on top (the light lip), a w/i lane dash low in the top tile
# (8 px on, 8 px off: the autotile can't see column parity, so every
# tile carries half a dash). Ends: lit i/m kerb end left, d right.
# Autotiled (D-020): anim `auto`, frame = neighbour mask
# (1 = same tile above, 2 = right, 4 = below, 8 = left; level edge = same).
sprite = tile_strasse
size   = 16x16
origin = 0,0
anim   = auto frames=16 ticks=1
---
frame auto 0
